{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5a30fe029976e32f74dd8d638366df32729aed4ed0e27a253bbec3abfa98e7e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5fc3b3e4bc1cd6daa54e0acff8aa1eb0003b95c98afc20a569ad4b52034a8808","slc_b12de7a42a913e612ebd42bb3c8cdd14a2716ce061e9183914464f117b3215e0","slc_be585c598237b209d55a7788db24b5091f36f3e46eb00be231a39cef54ddb913"],"source_ids":["src_537cc59157de59569296c20660b40a32"],"text":"Settings include vim keybindings, auto_compact with compact_threshold, auto_continue policy (off/goal/always), status-bar toggles for tokens/sec, tokens, cost, ghost-text prediction, tips, and file icons.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_acbce7f7e4efc9de0b1797f4bc411228bd9c7f65c7e84b181ad59099e8bc1cd6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cd3e56ccf427454601ebd5cae8d52f1f1a56a1c8108df92720dfde1db02ab546","slc_d1b8eb752047e17f2870bf10e7cfe62953f2336cbb9814d7ea0a8caf3c406129","slc_fd59428456bab7e5eed3875246d488c83370aabe0006d09376697daa06fc4602"],"source_ids":["src_5fba37715dec57a3970e0654d6cf6105"],"text":"smelt can run with no config, using flags alone, or via `smelt auth` for ChatGPT, GitHub Copilot, and Kimi Code; running bare `smelt` auto-detects the provider from credentials.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b0efe2776c7fb3c82a3b7415cdacdaee59ee8940d2b92d7293699a2547de174c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_72caed92c0e7b60dbf7cca26e34ae5c79b79e44cb62f2c29b7301b3fc9ecdc76","slc_99e1a8c60d89cb471d7c88f377e9461ff8415a05fcb42dc1b80986d03e796f6a"],"source_ids":["src_5fba37715dec57a3970e0654d6cf6105"],"text":"The project positions itself as a small, fast coding agent scriptable in Lua like Neovim, built from scratch rather than on an existing framework.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_ba8b7cc4faf92af58534650938aee715415889d820e3db07e44698f7504bf6c0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=workflows","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4695c9415fa14d706e52903f432fbfc81ed296214ff04a4aa3c9678166edfd51","slc_c0b616ad697a0c6c97648da8325f779d9ca8095cb9209e73e5d89e5dd390265f"],"source_ids":["src_537cc59157de59569296c20660b40a32","src_e26d951cba7258bda00b31b8e206ddcc"],"text":"Lua API reference docs are auto-generated by `cargo xtask gen-lua-docs` and marked do-not-edit, suggesting a docs-generation step in the development workflow, though no contributor guide appears in the evidence.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bd6dcefa5ffa7807ab0f95ab46f17c85fd7badf0d7d7ddf9300bf463fed0ba6c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_64944fd5324b7f28c58fa0de473d3cc090ad3e76b42e76caad92945ffab3f756"],"source_ids":["src_5fba37715dec57a3970e0654d6cf6105"],"text":"The default mode cycle is Normal → Plan → Apply → Yolo, with Plan mode bundled and autoloaded; optional bundled plugins include which_key, a local request inspector, and LSP-backed semantic code tools enabled from init.lua.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d65c795f0455f223c964bacc83efea63eb11ae5e86f7c96c8f3fd2f6f37e3ce3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4097a77d650796c85345b711d22ef75d9fe9da188371a85e55b09b81734fb29d","slc_5fe7248227aa21f2b09d2a8756bfa08543a9018feecbbf3b81afa77f1cc2dae0","slc_70ed98ee5e3485465810a14a69680b868cb07d9ba7deea08aaf3cd67c46eaa1e"],"source_ids":["src_537cc59157de59569296c20660b40a32"],"text":"Providers are registered via smelt.provider.register with types including openai-compatible, openai, codex, anthropic-compatible, anthropic, copilot, and kimi-code; unknown types fall back to openai-compatible and re-registering a name replaces the entry.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_df9499a52a05b86fa093a3b46141aeede7329907f49ed7402a9897a2a36354eb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_558842da443e5673482a4919c9c24a46df2148a4fd30838392918b96a19146c9","slc_f7bb53c7082d205e3dcd4d1e84ac335a9d387381137e57be8f660bd7ceab7392"],"source_ids":["src_537cc59157de59569296c20660b40a32","src_e26d951cba7258bda00b31b8e206ddcc"],"text":"smelt.config.runtime_status() returns sanitized runtime and reload diagnostics including revisions, pending reload state, model selection, and controller convergence, and never includes credential values or Lua source contents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f3e9c6df55d810327d9835759ba11e8bdfe1cc9cf1341c20ffca272abc5fd926","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"leonardcser/smelt@9a7e6536df52 snapshot 1b7df65587b36aa1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0317eb2aa2a4e2f0241ca7b86cbf6e665651c32ccc853789c5d2ebacb2859f91","slc_296c0cdb9bebc06842db25d1368b8df57ceea6c2213ee3e11b27bf14119b9586","slc_92fc8eea530ccb92f643c29361bea8740643be97af225680c5fee0c97cdddc3c"],"source_ids":["src_537cc59157de59569296c20660b40a32"],"text":"Configuration lives at ~/.config/smelt/init.lua (or %APPDATA%\\smelt\\init.lua on Windows, with $XDG_CONFIG_HOME overriding), can be pointed at another file with --config, and a first-launch wizard writes a starter init.lua when none exists.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f444d500a594b6db8f54be079140636"}
